sequenceDiagram
    participant usr_employee as "Employee"
    participant ui_app as "mobile-app (Compose)"
    participant svc_api as "api (FastAPI)"
    participant db_postgres as "PostgreSQL"
    usr_employee->>ui_app: sign in on S-01
    ui_app->>svc_api: POST /api/auth/login
    svc_api-->>ui_app: 200 access_token JWT HS256 exp = issued + 28800 seconds - claims sub role exp (CONF-001)
    Note over ui_app: token stored Keystore-backed - never plain text or logs (CONF-002, BR-006)
    loop every protected call while the session lasts
        ui_app->>svc_api: GET /api/incidents or POST /api/incidents or GET /api/incidents/{id} or GET /api/me - Authorization Bearer JWT
        Note over svc_api: decode pinned to algorithms HS256 allow-list (BR-004)
        svc_api-->>ui_app: 200 responses
    end
    alt employee taps Salir on S-02
        Note over ui_app: NO server sign-out endpoint and NO refresh endpoint (Q-008) - client deletes the Keystore token (FUNC-002, BR-005)
        ui_app-->>usr_employee: confirmation toast - route to S-01 - protected screens unreachable
    else token expired after 8 hours
        svc_api-->>ui_app: 401 detail No autenticado
        Note over ui_app: expired-token recovery flow - clear token - route S-01
    else account deactivated mid-session (active = false)
        svc_api-->>ui_app: 403 detail Cuenta inactiva
        ui_app-->>usr_employee: clear token - route S-01 (INSTR-001 rationale)
    end
